stdout: {"type":"runFinished","data":{"sessionId":"sess_7e3c7691-cf5b-4736-98ab-797e44c57a9f","status":"success","stopReason":"end_turn","finalText":"I wrote `server.py` in the workspace directory, following the prompt's ten rules. I didn't run or test it, as the prompt required.\n\nWhere the prompt left a detail open, I made these choices:\n- **Index layout:** `donor/index.json` keeps its symbols under an `entries` key, so the server reads them from there.\n- **Content-Type:** I set `Content-Type` explicitly to `text/csv` and `text/html`. Left to FastAPI, it would append `; charset=utf-8`.\n- **Row dates:** The server reads each row's date from the first field of each line and skips the header line.\n\nI created no other files.","finalTextTruncated":false}}
